flowchart LR
    A[Choose two candidate patterns] --> B[Run shared scenario set]
    B --> C[Capture traces and metrics]
    C --> D[Score latency cost quality]
    D --> E[Compare against single-agent baseline]
    E --> F{Meets target?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Adopt pattern in production]
    F -->|No| H[Adjust pattern or switch topology]
    H --> B